            <div xml:id="d917">

                <pb facs="0884" n="872" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg872"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890F.515/16: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Appointed Minister Resident in Saudi Arabia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Moose</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jidda</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-06-24T16:00:00+03:06">June 24, 1943—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 8:34 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>58. My 55, June 22, 5 p.m. Today a sovereign costing $21 will purchase only 38½
                    riyals making riyal value 54.54 cents. No new gold has yet arrived.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moose</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
